    "detailed_description": "<h1>What's in the Full Release</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/7499fcfc26d37dbfa47326550d22285f.avif?t=1751032212\" data-has-big width=800 height=1316 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From the Creators of &quot;Demon King\u2019s End&quot; comes their latest masterpiece! A gunslinger with magic at your fingertips!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/ff7daf65d5d07fe61ec21120be0550e8.poster.avif?t=1751032212\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/ff7daf65d5d07fe61ec21120be0550e8.webm?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/ff7daf65d5d07fe61ec21120be0550e8.mp4?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years of hard work, the young mage finally saved up enough to build a beautiful house deep in the woods. But what she didn\u2019t realize was that her new home was right next to a rift between the Shadow Realm and the Mortal Realm\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night falls, monstrous shadowspawn creatures pour through the rift, destroying everything in their path. Armed with her Arcane Rifle, the mage is ready to pull the trigger and unleash a storm of fury on these rude invaders!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mix &amp; Match for Max Damage! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think twice before pulling the trigger! Repositioning your bullets to create the ultimate buff combo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/f5a1eaf97f1b9d3be8bf9bf896bbd07d.poster.avif?t=1751032212\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/f5a1eaf97f1b9d3be8bf9bf896bbd07d.webm?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/f5a1eaf97f1b9d3be8bf9bf896bbd07d.mp4?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft New Bullets!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the winged hammer to craft powerful new bullets with unique boosts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/6188ed30651f8de23502d9223db24a9e.poster.avif?t=1751032212\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/6188ed30651f8de23502d9223db24a9e.webm?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/6188ed30651f8de23502d9223db24a9e.mp4?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Authentic Roguelike Vibe!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each round, pick the perfect perk based on your build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/22a1b6881232f86c1205d1f08c26da77.poster.avif?t=1751032212\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/22a1b6881232f86c1205d1f08c26da77.webm?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/22a1b6881232f86c1205d1f08c26da77.mp4?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the Mage\u2019s Allies: Alongside the mage, her trusty friends are ready to join the fight. The Grand Sorcerer, the Judge, the Adventurer, and the Shaman are all here to back you up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose from different types of magical bullets and powerful Arcane firearms to lay down some serious firepower! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge new bullets during combat, activate a variety of rune effects, and chain them together for devastating combos. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, the monsters grow stronger and each night brings new dangers to face. Expect a wide range of magical creatures that can either aid you in battle\u2026 or increase the danger you face!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/91a376fc1d7f52530998f79bd6492a6f.poster.avif?t=1751032212\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/91a376fc1d7f52530998f79bd6492a6f.webm?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/91a376fc1d7f52530998f79bd6492a6f.mp4?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From the Creators of &quot;Demon King\u2019s End&quot; comes their latest masterpiece! A gunslinger with magic at your fingertips!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/ff7daf65d5d07fe61ec21120be0550e8.poster.avif?t=1751032212\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/ff7daf65d5d07fe61ec21120be0550e8.webm?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/ff7daf65d5d07fe61ec21120be0550e8.mp4?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years of hard work, the young mage finally saved up enough to build a beautiful house deep in the woods. But what she didn\u2019t realize was that her new home was right next to a rift between the Shadow Realm and the Mortal Realm\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night falls, monstrous shadowspawn creatures pour through the rift, destroying everything in their path. Armed with her Arcane Rifle, the mage is ready to pull the trigger and unleash a storm of fury on these rude invaders!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mix &amp; Match for Max Damage! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think twice before pulling the trigger! Repositioning your bullets to create the ultimate buff combo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/f5a1eaf97f1b9d3be8bf9bf896bbd07d.poster.avif?t=1751032212\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/f5a1eaf97f1b9d3be8bf9bf896bbd07d.webm?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/f5a1eaf97f1b9d3be8bf9bf896bbd07d.mp4?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft New Bullets!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the winged hammer to craft powerful new bullets with unique boosts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/6188ed30651f8de23502d9223db24a9e.poster.avif?t=1751032212\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/6188ed30651f8de23502d9223db24a9e.webm?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/6188ed30651f8de23502d9223db24a9e.mp4?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Authentic Roguelike Vibe!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each round, pick the perfect perk based on your build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/22a1b6881232f86c1205d1f08c26da77.poster.avif?t=1751032212\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/22a1b6881232f86c1205d1f08c26da77.webm?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/22a1b6881232f86c1205d1f08c26da77.mp4?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the Mage\u2019s Allies: Alongside the mage, her trusty friends are ready to join the fight. The Grand Sorcerer, the Judge, the Adventurer, and the Shaman are all here to back you up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose from different types of magical bullets and powerful Arcane firearms to lay down some serious firepower! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge new bullets during combat, activate a variety of rune effects, and chain them together for devastating combos. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, the monsters grow stronger and each night brings new dangers to face. Expect a wide range of magical creatures that can either aid you in battle\u2026 or increase the danger you face!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/91a376fc1d7f52530998f79bd6492a6f.poster.avif?t=1751032212\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/91a376fc1d7f52530998f79bd6492a6f.webm?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981070/extras/91a376fc1d7f52530998f79bd6492a6f.mp4?t=1751032212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
